WEBVTT

00:14:26.597 --> 00:14:30.237
Without them, humanity cannot survive.

00:14:32.341 --> 00:14:36.104
In other words, they are fundamental
to human existence.

00:14:37.644 --> 00:14:42.639
Domestic workers are in charge
of the fundamentals.

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:45.992
They love and they care,

00:14:46.016 --> 00:14:48.993
and they show compassion no matter what.

00:14:52.016 --> 00:14:56.441
We live in a time of moral choices

00:14:57.417 --> 00:14:59.077
everywhere we turn:

00:14:59.101 --> 00:15:00.755
at the border,